{#
  BeMart admin Product list — EC-CUBE goProductList (商品一覧).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Product/index.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Product/index.twig).

  Product section, DATA/LIST + search-form page. It extends the admin
  frame (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin
  `default_frame.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup
  skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from
  EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound to the ProductList
  resource body (src/Resource/Page/Admin/ProductList.php — body carries
  `products` (a list of {productCode, productName, price02, stock,
  productStatus}), `count`, `filters` and an AdminProductSearchForm
  exposed as `searchForm`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route, params)` / `path(...)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `form_widget(searchForm.id)` -> `searchForm.input('id')` — the real
     AdminProductSearchForm keyword box (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - The detail-search panel's `form_widget(searchForm.<field>)` calls
     (category / tag / display-status / stock / create-date / update-date)
     -> the ProductList resource supports ONLY the free-text keyword
     (Wave 8 first iteration — see ProductList's docblock).
     AdminProductSearchForm declares only `id`, so those widgets render
     EMPTY. The panel STRUCTURE (rows / labels / collapse) is kept
     verbatim; the empty widgets are an enumerated residual.
   - `{% for Product in pagination %}` -> the resource body's `products`
     list. EC-CUBE's `pagination` is a KnpPaginator; the list endpoint
     returns the full collection (no server-side paging in scope), so the
     `pageMaxis` page-count dropdown + the `@admin/pager.twig` block are
     OMITTED. Enumerated as residual.
   - `Product.id` -> the BeMart projection keys by `productCode` (no
     surrogate int id); the row id / edit links use `productCode`. EC-CUBE
     keys by `Product.id` — same anchors / classes, only the id param
     differs. Enumerated as residual.
   - `Product.mainFileName` image thumbnail -> the ProductListFetched
     projection does NOT carry product images (out of the Wave 8
     shallow-grid slice). The image `<td>` renders an empty cell, not
     invented. FLAGGED for enrichment follow-up.
   - `Product.code_min`/`code_max`, `Product.price02_min`/`max`,
     `Product.hasProductClass`, `Product.create_date`/`update_date`,
     `Product.status.name` -> the projection carries a flat
     `productCode` / `price02` / `stock` / `productStatus`; the
     ProductClass min/max aggregates and the create/update timestamps are
     NOT carried (Wave 8 shallow-grid slice). The min/max ranges collapse
     to the single value; the create/update cells render empty.
     FLAGGED for enrichment follow-up.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the copy / bulk-status anchors -> EC-CUBE
     per-request CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront ports
     omit it.
   - `search_items.twig` include (saved-search chips) -> EC-CUBE admin
     fragment with no BeMart equivalent; dropped (the render-diff loader
     serves it empty).
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_product' %}
{% set title = '商品一覧' %}
{% set sub_title = '商品管理' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $(function() {
            $('#bulkDelete').on('click', function() {

                var modal = $('#bulkDeleteModal');

                // 削除中のUI変更処理
                modal.find('button').attr('disabled', 'disabled');
                $('.modal-body p', modal).text("削除中...");
                $('.progress', modal).show();

                var checkedList = $('input[type=checkbox][data-delete-url]:checked');
                var totalCount = checkedList.length;
                var currentCount = 0;

                var promises = checkedList.map(function() {
                    return $.ajax({
                        'url': $(this).data('delete-url'),
                        'type': 'delete',
                        'data': {'_token': $(this).attr('token-for-anchor')}
                    }).always(function() {
                        $('.progress-bar', modal).css('width', (++currentCount / totalCount * 100) + '%');
                    });
                });

                var addError = function(errorMessage) {
                    $('<li><span class="badge bg-danger">ERROR</span> </li>')
                        .append($('<span></span>').text(errorMessage))
                        .appendTo('#bulkErrors');
                };

                $.when.apply($, promises)
                    .done(function() {
                        // 削除できなかった場合はエラーメッセージを表示
                        var args = promises.length === 1 ? [arguments[0]] : [].slice.call(arguments).map(function(result) {
                            return result[0];
                        });
                        args.filter(function(result) {
                            return result.success === false;
                        }).forEach(function(result) {
                            addError(result.message);
                        });
                    })
                    .fail(function() {
                        // システムエラー
                        addError("システムエラーが発生しました");
                    })
                    .always(function() {
                        $('.progress', modal).hide();
                        $('.modal-body p', modal).text("商品の削除処理が完了しました");
                        modal.find('button').removeAttr('disabled').toggle();
                    })
            });

            $('#bulkDeleteDone').on('click', function() {
                location.reload(true);
            });

            toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '#btn_bulk');
            $('input[id^="check_"]').on('change', function() {
                $('#trigger_check_all').prop('checked', false);
                toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '#btn_bulk');
            });

            $('#trigger_check_all').on('change', function() {
                var checked = $(this).prop('checked');
                if (checked) {
                    $('input[id^="check_"]').prop('checked', true);
                } else {
                    $('input[id^="check_"]').prop('checked', false);
                }
                toggleBtnBulk('input[id^="check_"]', '#btn_bulk');
            });

            $('#form_bulk').find('.action-submit').on('click', function(event) {
                event.preventDefault();
                var form = $(this).closest('form');
                if (!form.find('input:checkbox[name^="ids"]:checked').length) {
                    alert('please check');
                    return false;
                }

                $('<input />').attr('type', 'hidden').attr('name', '_token')
                    .val($(this).attr('token-for-anchor'))
                    .appendTo(form);
                form.attr('action', $(this).data('action')).submit();
                return false;
            });

            var dataClass = [];
            var modalClass = $('#productClassesModal');
            $('form#form_bulk').on('click', 'table.table button[data-class-url]', function() {
                var btnClass = $(this);
                btnClass.attr('disabled', true);
                var productId = btnClass.data('product-id');

                if (dataClass[productId] != undefined) {
                    renderClass(dataClass[productId], btnClass);
                    return;
                }

                $.ajax({
                    url: btnClass.data('class-load'),
                    type: 'GET',
                }).done(function(data) {
                    dataClass[productId] = data;
                    renderClass(dataClass[productId], btnClass);
                }).fail(function() {
                    alert('Failed');
                });
            });

            // Append html and show popup
            function renderClass(data, btnClass) {
                $('div.modal-body', modalClass).html(data);
                $('h5.modal-title', modalClass).text(btnClass.data('message'));
                $('a.btn-ec-conversion', modalClass).attr('href', btnClass.data('class-url'));
                modalClass.modal('show');
                btnClass.attr('disabled', false);
            }
        });
    </script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-outsideBlock">
        <form id='search_form' method="post" action="{{ url('admin_product') }}">
            <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents">
                <div class="row justify-content-start">

                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="col-form-label" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="情報を入力して一覧の絞り込み検索ができます。より詳細な条件を指定するには［詳細検索］を開いてください。">商品名・商品ID・商品コード<i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i></label>
                            {{ searchForm.input('id')|raw }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-inline-block mb-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#searchDetail"
                             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="searchDetail"><a><i
                                        class="fa fa-plus-square-o fw-bold me-1"></i><span
                                        class="fw-bold">詳細検索</span></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="c-subContents collapse ec-collapse" id="searchDetail">
                <div class="row mb-2">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="col-form-label">カテゴリ</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <p class="col-form-label">公開ステータス</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <p class="col-form-label">在庫</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="row mb-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="col-form-label">タグ</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="col-form-label">
                                登録日
                            </label>
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col">
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-auto text-center"><span>〜</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="col-form-label">更新日</label>
                            <div class="row align-items-center">
                                <div class="col">
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-auto"><span>〜</span></div>
                                <div class="col">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents mb-5">
                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5" type="submit">検索</button>
                <span class="fw-bold ms-2">検索結果：{{ count }}件が該当しました</span>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="row justify-content-end mb-3">
                    <div class="col-auto">
                        <a class="btn btn-ec-conversion" href="{{ url('admin_product_product_new') }}">
                            <i class="fa fa-plus me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span>商品登録</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {% if count %}
                    <form id="form_bulk" method="POST" action="">
                        <div class="row justify-content-between mb-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <div id="btn_bulk" class="d-none">
                                    <label class="me-2">一括操作</label>
                                    <div class="btn-group me-2" role="group">
                                        <button data-action="{{ url('admin_product_bulk_product_status') }}" class="btn btn-ec-regular action-submit" type="button">
                                            <span>公開</span>
                                        </button>
                                        <button data-action="{{ url('admin_product_bulk_product_status') }}" class="btn btn-ec-regular action-submit" type="button">
                                            <span>非公開</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>
                                    <button data-action="{{ url('admin_product_bulk_product_status') }}" class="btn btn-ec-regular me-2 action-submit">
                                        廃止
                                    </button>
                                    <button type="button" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#bulkDeleteModal" class="btn btn-ec-delete">削除</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-5 text-end">
                                <div class="d-inline-block">
                                    <div class="btn-group" role="group">
                                        <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="{{ url('admin_product_export') }}">
                                            <i class="fa fa-cloud-download me-1 text-secondary"></i><span>CSVダウンロード</span>
                                        </a>
                                        <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="{{ url('admin_setting_shop_csv') }}">
                                            <i class="fa fa-cog me-1 text-secondary"></i><span>CSV出力項目設定</span>
                                        </a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4 d-block">
                            <div class="card-body p-0">
                                <table class="table table-sm">
                                    <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 ps-3 pt-2 pb-2">
                                            <input type="checkbox" name="filter" value="open" id="trigger_check_all">
                                        </th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2" nowrap>ID<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="product_id"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">画像</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">商品名<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="name"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">コード<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="product_code"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">価格</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">在庫数<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="stock"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 text-nowrap">公開状態<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="status"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">登録日<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="create_date"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2">更新日<a href="#" class="js-listSort" data-sortkey="update_date"><i class="fa fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-2 pe-3" colspan="3"></th>
                                    </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                    {% for Product in products %}
                                        <tr id="ex-product-{{ Product.productCode }}">
                                            <td class="align-middle ps-3">
                                                <input type="checkbox" name="ids[]" value="{{ Product.productCode }}" id="check_{{ Product.productCode }}" data-delete-url="{{ url('admin_product_product_delete', { id: Product.productCode }) }}">
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">{{ Product.productCode }}</td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                <a href="{{ url('admin_product_product_edit', { id : Product.productCode }) }}">
                                                    <img src="{{ asset(Product.imagePath|default('assets/img/common/no_image_product.png'), 'save_image') }}"
                                                         alt="{{ Product.productName }}" style="width: 64px; height: 64px; object-fit: cover;">
                                                </a>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle"><a
                                                        href="{{ url('admin_product_product_edit', { id : Product.productCode }) }}">{{ Product.productName }}</a>
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                {{ Product.productCode }}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                {{ Product.price02|price }}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                {% if Product.stock is null %}
                                                    無制限
                                                {% else %}
                                                    {{ Product.stock }}
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                                {{ Product.productStatus }}
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle">
                                            </td>
                                            <td class="align-middle pe-3" colspan="3">
                                                <div class="text-end">
                                                    <div class="px-1 d-inline-block text-center" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                                                         data-bs-placement="top"
                                                         title="表示"><a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon"
                                                                                                       href="{{ url('product_detail', {id:Product.productCode}) }}"
                                                                                                       target="_blank"><i
                                                                    class="fa fa-eye fa-lg text-secondary"
                                                                    aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div>
                                                    <div class="px-1 d-inline-block text-center" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                                                         data-bs-placement="top"
                                                         title="複製">
                                                        <a href="#" class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon"
                                                           data-bs-toggle="modal"
                                                           data-bs-target="#confirmModal-{{ Product.productCode }}">
                                                            <i class="fa fa-files-o fa-lg text-secondary"
                                                               aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                                                        <div class="modal fade" id="confirmModal-{{ Product.productCode }}" tabindex="-1"
                                                             role="dialog"
                                                             aria-labelledby="confirmModal-{{ Product.productCode }}" aria-hidden="true">
                                                            <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                                                <div class="modal-content">
                                                                    <div class="modal-header">
                                                                        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                                            商品を複製します</h5>
                                                                        <button class="btn-close" type="button"
                                                                                data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                                                                                aria-label="Close">
                                                                        </button>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                                                        <p class="text-start">
                                                                            商品を複製してよろしいですか？</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    <div class="modal-footer">
                                                                        <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button"
                                                                                data-bs-dismiss="modal">キャンセル
                                                                        </button>
                                                                        <a
                                                                                href="{{ url('admin_product_product_copy', {'id' : Product.productCode}) }}"
                                                                                class="btn btn-ec-conversion"
                                                                                data-confirm="false"
                                                                                data-method="post">
                                                                            複製
                                                                        </a>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    {% endfor %}

                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="card rounded border-0">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <div class="text-center text-muted mb-4 h5">検索条件に合致するデータが見つかりませんでした</div>
                            <div class="text-center text-muted">検索条件を変えて、再度検索をお試しください</div>
                            <div class="text-center text-muted">[詳細検索]も試してみましょう</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <!-- 完全に削除の確認モーダル-->
            <div class="modal fade" id="bulkDeleteModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="discontinuance" aria-hidden="true" data-bs-keyboard="false" data-bs-backdrop="static">
                <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                    <div class="modal-content">
                        <div class="modal-header">
                            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">商品を削除します</h5>
                            <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="modal-body text-start">
                            <p class="text-start">商品を削除してよろしいですか？</p>
                            <ul id="bulkErrors"></ul>
                            <div class="progress" style="display: none">
                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%" aria-valuenow="0" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="modal-footer">
                            <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">キャンセル</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-ec-delete" type="button" id="bulkDelete">削除</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-ec-regular" id="bulkDeleteDone" style="display: none" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">完了</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal fade" id="productClassesModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="productClassesModal" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold"></h5>
                    <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button class="btn btn-v-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                        キャンセル
                    </button>
                    <a class="btn btn-ec-conversion"
                       href="#">
                        商品規格の編集
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div><!-- /.modal-content -->
        </div><!-- /.modal-dialog -->
    </div><!-- /#productClassesModal -->
{% endblock %}
